  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;&quot;&gt;The proposed painting of the elevation and new window at ground floor level appears as an incongruous form of development which fails to respect the window hierarchy of the building and the integrity of the building, harming both the special interest of the Listed Building and the character and appearance of the conservation area. As such the development is contrary to Policy HC1 (Heritage and Growth) of the London Plan (2021) and Policy LP3 (Designated Heritage Assets) of the Hackney Local Plan (2020).&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
